{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2022-11-07 11:10:00', 'title': 'LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES LAUNCHES ITS FIRST EDGE COMPUTING SOLUTION FOR ASIA PACIFIC', 'text': 'BUSINESSES CAN SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCE LATENCY AND MAXIMISE SECURITY AND PERFORMANCE WITH LUMEN EDGE BARE METAL SERVICES SINGAPORE , NOV. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES ("LUMEN"), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HIGH-SPEED EDGE COMPUTING PLATFORMS AND SOLUTIONS, LAUNCHED ITS EDGE BARE METAL SERVICES FOR THE ASIA PACIFIC ("APAC") MARKET. THE MOVE MARKS THE COMPANY\'S CONTINUED INVESTMENT IN ITS EDGE INFRASTRUCTURE AND SUITE OF SERVICES FOR THE REGION, SUPPORTING ENTERPRISE INNOVATIONS AND DATA-INTENSIVE APPLICATIONS OF THE 4TH INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION.'}